                    Secret. The meeting took place in the White House Situation Room.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f2" n="2" xml:id="d27-f2-content">
                <p>After Ambassador Hummel left Addis Ababa on July 6, 1976 (see <ref
                        target="frus1969-76ve06#d162">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, vol. E–6,
                        Documents on Africa, Document 162</ref>), there was no Ambassador at the
                    Embassy until Chapin arrived at post on
                    July 21, 1978.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
